# 1. All the packages you need to install

To start the server: npm run dev

To install Tailwind v4: npm install tailwindcss @tailwindcss/vite
To install Nodemon: npm install --save-dev nodemon
  - you can then use npm run dev to start the backend server at port 3000, and the server will automatically restart everytime the backend is changed, meaning you don't have to manually restart it
To install cookie-parser: npm install cookie-parser
To install TanStack Table: npm install @tanstack/react-table
To install React QR Code: npm install react-qr-code
To install nodemailer: npm install express nodemailer body-parser
To install dotenv: npm install dotenv

